Hi there!
I am the Game Director.{VAR BE01}
Oh! You've caught every kind of
Pokémon in Unova!{VAR BE01}
Wow! Excellent!
We'll give you an award!!{VAR BE01}

Hi there!
I am the Game Director.{VAR BE01}
Oh! Excellent! You've finally collected
all the Pokémon and completed{VAR BE00}
your Pokédex!{VAR BE01}
To honor the efforts you have made in
completing this Pokédex...{VAR BE01}
Allow me to present you with this award!{VAR BE01}

How did you meet all the Pokémon
to fill up your Pokédex?{VAR BE01}
Did you work long and hard to catch
and raise them?{VAR BE01}
Did you receive them as gifts from
friends?{VAR BE01}
Maybe you got some in trades from
around the world?{VAR BE01}
Though everyone's Pokédex may look the
same, the stories they contain are{VAR BE00}
all unique!

A tip for getting strong
in Pokémon battles...{VAR BE01}
Let me see.
I guess the most important thing is...{VAR BE00}
having a lot of battles!{VAR BE01}
If you become very strong, come back
and have a Pokémon battle with me!

You think about battles very thoroughly.{VAR BE01}
I lost, but I learned a lot from you.
Besides, it was fun!{VAR BE01}
Come back again tomorrow.

No?{VAR BE01}
I've been raising Pokémon, thinking about
their Abilities and just the right{VAR BE00}
combination of held items.{VAR BE01}
What a pity...

I'm Snorlax.{VAR BE01}
No, no. I'm the Planner!{VAR BE01}
I don't mean to butt in, but the
Leftovers item is important, isn't it?

I am the Sound Designer!{VAR BE01}
I put in a lot of wonderful mechanisms
to change the game's music!{VAR BE01}
How many of them have you noticed?

I can tell you take the sound seriously,
so here's a treat for you!{VAR BE01}
What do you think about this
dramatic sound?{VAR BE01}

Were you surprised?{VAR BE01}
Well, for a strong Trainer like you,
winning against Team Rocket{VAR BE00}
would be a piece of cake!
